# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules

# Build output is ignored, EXCEPT the committed dist/index.html placeholder:
# //go:embed all:dist in embed.go fails the Go build outright if dist is missing
# or empty, so a fresh clone must contain that one file. The pattern must be
# `dist/*` rather than `dist` -- git never descends into an ignored directory,
# which would make the negation below unreachable.
dist/*
!dist/index.html
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
